    },
    {
      "id": "i4",
      "content": "or see a list of new copies."
    },
    {
      "id": "i5",
      "content": "Alternatively, they can also view a list of used copies."
    },
    {
      "id": "i6",
      "content": "If they choose to view the book details, they have the option to then"
    },
    {
      "id": "i7",
      "content": "view a list of new copies"
    },
    {
      "id": "i8",
      "content": "or proceed to select a copy and end the process."
    },
    {
      "id": "i9",
      "content": "end the process."
    },
    {
